# Environment files. The previous list named only `.env` and `.env.local`, so
# `.env.vercel` was committed in Oct 2025 carrying a live Supabase
# service_role key (valid to 2035), a MailerSend token and a Resend key. All
# three are now dead and that Supabase project is deleted, but the blob is
# still reachable in git history. Match the whole family, and keep the
# checked-in example explicitly allowed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/

# Ignore markdown files across the repo while keeping the top-level README.md and docs folder tracked
**/*.md
!README.md
!docs/**/*.md

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Mobile app build artifacts (not deploying mobile version)
apps/mobile/dist/
apps/mobile/.expo/
apps/mobile/node_modules/
*.expo
.expo-shared/
branch_structure.json
temp_auto_push.bat
temp_interactive_push.bat
*.tsbuildinfo
